---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import { tour } from '../../data/content';
import { asset } from '../../lib/asset';
---

<dialog id="tour-signup" class="modal modal-bottom sm:modal-middle" aria-labelledby="tour-signup-title">
  <div class="modal-box max-w-lg rounded-t-3xl p-0 sm:rounded-3xl">
    <header class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-blue px-6 pt-6 pb-8 text-white">
      <div
        class="absolute -top-8 -right-8 size-28 rounded-[60%_40%_30%_70%/60%_30%_70%_40%] bg-brand-red"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>
      <form method="dialog">
        <button class="btn btn-circle btn-ghost btn-sm absolute top-4 right-4 text-white" aria-label="Cerrar">
          <Icon name="lucide:x" class="size-5" />
        </button>
      </form>
      <p class="font-script text-2xl">Tour Escolar</p>
      <h3 id="tour-signup-title" class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Inscribe tu colegio</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 max-w-xs text-sm text-white/85">Déjanos tus datos y te contactamos para programar la visita.</p>
    </header>

    <form class="grid gap-4 px-6 py-6" data-signup-form data-endpoint={tour.signupEndpoint} novalidate>
      <label class="form-control">
        <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Nombre del colegio *</span>
        <input name="school" required class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="organization" />
      </label>
      <label class="form-control">
        <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Dirección *</span>
        <input name="address" required class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="Ej. Cra. 7 #100-20" />
      </label>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <label class="form-control">
          <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Nombre de contacto *</span>
          <input name="contact" required class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="name" />
        </label>
        <label class="form-control">
          <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Cargo</span>
          <input name="role" class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Ej. Coordinador(a)" />
        </label>
        <label class="form-control">
          <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Correo *</span>
          <input name="email" type="email" required class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="email" />
        </label>
        <label class="form-control">
          <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Teléfono *</span>
          <input name="phone" type="tel" required class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" autocomplete="tel" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <label class="form-control">
        <span class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Número aproximado de estudiantes</span>
        <input name="students" type="number" min="1" class="input w-full border-brand-blue/20 bg-brand-cream" inputmode="numeric" />
      </label>
      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm">
        <input name="consent" type="checkbox" required class="checkbox checkbox-primary checkbox-sm mt-0.5" />
        <span>
          Autorizo el tratamiento de mis datos personales de acuerdo con la Ley 1581 de 2012 y la
          <a href={asset('legal#datos-personales')} target="_blank" class="link font-semibold">política de tratamiento de datos</a>. *
        </span>
      </label>
      <p class="rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream p-3 text-xs text-brand-blue/75">
        <Icon name="lucide:shield-check" class="mr-1 inline size-4 align-text-bottom text-brand-red" />
        Durante el tour pueden tomarse fotos y videos. Su uso requiere autorización previa de padres o representantes y
        participar no depende de aceptarla.
        <a href={asset('legal#menores')} target="_blank" class="link font-semibold">Más información</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="min-h-5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-red" role="alert" data-signup-error></p>

      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary btn-block rounded-full" data-signup-submit>
        Enviar inscripción
        <Icon name="lucide:send" class="size-4" />
      </button>
    </form>

    <div class="hidden flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 py-10 text-center" data-signup-success>
      <span class="grid size-16 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand-blue text-white">
        <Icon name="lucide:party-popper" class="size-8" />
      </span>
      <h4 class="text-xl font-extrabold">¡Gracias por inscribirte!</h4>
      <p class="max-w-xs text-sm text-brand-blue/75">Pronto nos pondremos en contacto para llevar el Tour Escolar a tu colegio.</p>
      <form method="dialog">
        <button class="btn btn-primary mt-2 rounded-full px-8">Cerrar</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form method="dialog" class="modal-backdrop">
    <button aria-label="Cerrar">cerrar</button>
  </form>
</dialog>
